                            <div class=3D"card-header pt-0" style=3D"text-a=
lign: center;">
                                <h3 class=3D"card-title mb-4">MAHARERA</h3>
                                <p>CA. Mahadev Birla/ CA Vivek Laddha, CA. =
Sumit Kapure</p>
                            </div>
                            <p><strong>I. MahaRERA/CC / 729 / 2024 dated 02=
.02.2024</strong></p>
                            <p><strong>Regulation of Retirement Homes in Ma=
harashtra</strong></p>
                            <p>MahaRERA has issued order directing the prom=
oter to ensure the fulfilment of some minimum physical specifications in th=
eir projects before advertising them as =E2=80=9CRetirement Home / Senior H=
ome / Equivalent=E2=80=9D.</p>
                            <p>Followings are the requirements</p>
                            <p><strong>Building Design</strong></p>
                            <ol style=3D"list-style-type: lower-alpha;">
                            <li>
                            <p> Lift for the building having more than one =
floor</p>
                            </li>
                            <li>
                            <p> Internal and external design of building sp=
aces should consider the free movement of wheelchairs.</p>
                            </li>
                            <li>
                            <p> Door openings (between jambs) should not be=
 less than 900 mm in width</p>
                            </li>
                            <li>
                            <p> Use of sliding window</p>
                            </li>
                            <li>
                            <p> Easy to grip door knobs and lever types han=
dles of large size to be used</p>
                            </li>
                            <li>
                            <p> Ergonomic design of furniture</p>
                            </li>
                            <li>
                            <p> lightweight, sturdy furniture</p>
                            </li>
                            </ol>
                            <p><strong>Green Building Principles</strong></=
p>
                            <ol style=3D"list-style-type: lower-alpha;">
                            <li>
                            <p> There should be maximum (near -total) use o=
f non-polluting and renewable energy sources in retirement homes</p>
                            </li>
                            <li>
                            <p> The norms defined in chapter 10 and 14 oI m=
odel building bylaws 2016 should be complied with fully.</p>
                            </li>
                            </ol>
                            <p><strong>Lifts and Ramps</strong></p>
                            <ol style=3D"list-style-type: lower-alpha;">
                                <li>
                                <p>All lifts must have audio and visual sig=
nage and signalling systems and to accommodate users requiring assistance a=
nd using wheelchairs and similar equipment/ mobility tools.</p>
                                </li>
                                <li>
                                <p>Mandatory ramps to be incorporated into =
throughout the building to provide for wheelchair access</p>
                                </li>
                                </ol>
                            <p><strong>Staircase</strong></p>
                            <ol style=3D"list-style-type: lower-alpha;">
                            <li>
                            <p> width not less than 1500 mm</p>
                            </li>
                            <li>
                            <p> Handrails on both sides of stair flights.</=
p>
                            </li>
                            <li>
                            <p> Treads and risers as per the standards of h=
armonised guidelines</p>
                            </li>
                            <li>
                            <p> No more than L2 treads in a single flight</=
p>
                            </li>
                            <li>
                            <p> Spiral stairs should be avoided</p>
                            </li>
                            <li>
                            <p> Illuminated / fluorescent / radium strips s=
hould be installed on all stairs</p>
                            </li>
                            <li>
                            <p> Specification of lighting and ventilation o=
f staircases as per NBC</p>
                            </li>
                            <li>
                            <p>Handrails should be extended12 inch at top a=
nd bottom of the staircase and ramps. Ends of handrails should be rounded</=
p>
                            </li>
                            </ol>
                            <p><strong>Corridors</strong></p>
                            <ol style=3D"list-style-type: lower-alpha;">
                            <li>
                            <p> No Steps in corridors</p>
                            </li>
                            <li>
                            <p> It is essential to provide handrails along =
the walls on either side of the corridor, at suitable heights above the flo=
or level.</p>
                            </li>
                            </ol>
                            <p><strong>Kitchen</strong></p>
                            <ol style=3D"list-style-type: lower-alpha;">
                            <li>
                            <p> Design as per NBC</p>
                            </li>
                            <li>
                            <p> Mandatory =E2=80=98gas leak detection syste=
ms</p>
                            </li>
                            </ol>
                            <p><strong>Bathroom</strong></p>
                            <ol style=3D"list-style-type: lower-alpha;">
                            <li>
                            <p> provision of grab rails in Wash basins</p>
                            </li>
                            <li>
                            <p> anti skid tiles</p>
                            </li>
                            <li>
                            <p> Toilet paper roll dispensers should be able=
 to withstand heavy loads</p>
                            </li>
                            <li>
                            <p> outward opening doors to access bathrooms i=
n an emergency</p>
                            </li>
                            </ol>
                            <p><strong>Lightning and Ventilation</strong></=
p>
                            <ol style=3D"list-style-type: lower-alpha;">
                            <li>
                            <p> Power Back up facilities in each apartment<=
/p>
                            </li>
                            <li>
                            <p> lighting and ventilation in compliance to M=
BBL and NBC</p>
                            </li>
                            <li>
                            <p> Advocate lightings in the common areas incl=
uding corridors, lobby and lifts to be supplied undisrupted electricity wit=
h power backup facility</p>
                            </li>
                            </ol>
                            <p><strong>Safety and Security</strong></p>
                            <ol style=3D"list-style-type: lower-alpha;">
                            <li>
                            <p> Alarm system in the premises, especially wi=
th separate switches</p>
                            </li>
                            <li>
                            <p> Emergency alarm and lights controls at beds=
ide and bathrooms near toilet seat.</p>
                            </li>
                            <li>
                            <p> Appropriate safety measures in all electric=
al equipment</p>
                            </li>
                            <li>
                            <p> Properly trained and skilled security perso=
nnel</p>
                            </li>
                            <li>
                            <p> entry passes for all visitors including ser=
vice providers to be issued</p>
                            </li>
                            <li>
                            <p> CCTV cameras</p>
                            </li>
                            <li>
                            <p>Emergency fire-fighting services</p>
                            </li>
                            <li>
                            <p> Emergency and important contact numbers sho=
uld be provide to all residents and displayed in all common areas i.e. outs=
ide lifts.</p>
                            </li>
                            </ol>
                            <p>The above draft order is issued for the feed=
back of the all stakeholders.</p>
                            <p><strong>II. Order 50 dated 10.01.2024</stron=
g></p>
                            <p><strong>Double/ multiple registration of rea=
l estate project on the same project land or part thereof not to be permitt=
ed / allowed.</strong></p>
                            <p>Submission by promoters of a Declaration-cum=
-Undertaking a long with the application for registration of their real est=
ate project.</p>
                            <p>MahaRERA noticed that promoters apply for re=
gistration of their real estate project to be executed on a particular proj=
ect land even when there is a subsisting pending application submitted for =
registration of a real estate project by whatever name called to be execute=
d on the very same project land / part thereof or when there already exists=
 a real estate project by whatever name called registered with MahaRERA bei=
ng executed on the very same project land / part thereof.</p>
                            <p>Therefore, the order is issued that</p>
                            <p>a. While applying for registration of a real=
 estate project, promoters shall upload a Declaration-cum-Undertaking on th=
e Letterhead of the promoter in the format prescribed in this order contain=
ing the details as follows;</p>
                            <ul style=3D"list-style-type: none;">
                            <li>
                            <p>- Details about the application for registra=
tion of project</p>
                            </li>
                            <li>
                            <p>- Address/place of Land or the details of th=
e land where project is situated</p>
                            </li>
                            <li>
                            <p>- Undertaking that on the date of applicatio=
n there is/ are no subsisting pending application submitted to MahaRERA for=
 registration of real estate project(s) by whatever name called to be under=
taken on the project land / part thereof or there is / are no real estate p=
roject(s) by whatever name called, registered with MahaRERA being executed =
on the project land / part thereof.</p>
                            </li>
                            <li>
                            <p>- Undertaking that on the date of applicatio=
n there is / are no subsisting pending application submitted to MahaRERA fo=
r registration of real estate project(s) by whatever name called to be unde=
rtaken on the project land / part thereof or there is / are no real estate =
project(s) by whatever name called, registered with MahaRERA being executed=
 on the project land / part thereof and that the plans as approved by the C=
ompetent Authority in respect of the real estate project, project name for =
which the application is submitted for registration does not amend/ modify/=
 delete/ alter, the common / special amenities such as recreation / playgro=
und, parking, internal road(s), club house, gymnasium, swimming pool, play =
area (list not exhaustive) as the case may be, provided to the real estate =
projects in the layout already registered / to be registered with MahaRERA =
as well as the public amenities such as amenity plot, built up amenity, oth=
er public reservations (list not exhaustive) as the case may be, as approve=
d by the Competent Authority /Government of Maharashtra.</p>
                            </li>
                            </ul>
                            <p>b. In case of standalone building / building=
s for which MahaRERA registration is sought under single project registrati=
on number, declaring and undertaking as follows</p>
                            <p><em>=E2=80=9Cthat on the date of submission =
of the application for registration of their real estate project to be unde=
rtaken on land bearing CS No(s) ____ / CTS No(s) ____ / Final Plot No(s) __=
__ / Survey No(s) ____ _, Hissa No(s) ___ _ / Gat No(s) ____ I Khasra No(s)=
 ____ I Plot No(s) ____ lying and being at---=F4=80=80=83 Village ____ _ Ta=
luka ---=F4=80=80=84 District _____ admeasuring ___ _ sq. mtrs hereinafter =
ref erred to as the =E2=80=9Cproject land=E2=80=9D there is I are no subsis=
ting pending application submitted for registration of real estate project(=
s) by whatever name called to be undertaken on the very same project land I=
 part thereof or there is I are no real estate project(s) by whatever name =
called, registered with MahaRERA being executed on the project land/ part t=
hereof.=E2=80=9D</em></p>
                            <p>In case of layout development where MahaRERA=
 registration is sought for respective building(s) under different project =
registration numbers declaring and undertaking as follows;</p>
                            <p><em>=E2=80=9Cthat on the date of submission =
of their application for registration of their real estate project to be un=
dertaken on land bearing CS No(s) _____ / CTS No(s) ____ /Final Plot No(s) =
I Survey No(s) ____ ___, Hissa No(s) I Gat No(s) _____ / Khasra No(s) _____=
 / Plot No(s) _____ lying and being at Village Taluka District admeasuring =
sq. mtrs hereinafter ref erred to as the =E2=80=9Cproject land=E2=80=9D the=
re is are no subsisting pending application submitted for registration of r=
eal estate project(s) by whatever name called to be undertaken on the very =
same project land I part thereof or there is I are no real estate project(s=
) by whatever name called, registered with MahaRERA being executed on the p=
roject land/ part thereof and that the plans as approved by the Competent A=
uthority in respect of the real estate project for which the application is=
 submitted for registration does not amend I modify I delete /alter, the co=
mmon I special amenities such as recreation I playground, parking, internal=
 road(s), club house, gymnasium swimming pool, play area (list not exhausti=
ve) as the case may be provided to the real estate projects in the layout a=
lready registered I to be registered with MahaRERA as well as the public am=
enities such as amenity plot, built up amenity, other public reservation (l=
ist not exhaustive) as the case may be as approved by the Competent Authori=
ty I Government of Maharashtra=E2=80=9D</em></p>
